      "id": "tease_playful_002_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "軽くね。強くやると、私のほうが先に反省会を始めるから。",
      "translatedText": "Lightly, then. If I go too hard, I will start reflecting before you do.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "playful",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "tease_playful_002_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "tease_playful_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "あなた、やる気を探すために別の作業を増やす癖があるよね。",
      "translatedText": "You have a habit of creating extra work while looking for motivation.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "playful",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "tease_playful_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "tease_playful_002_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "でも、気持ちは分かる。整った入口って、ちょっと甘い罠だから。",
      "translatedText": "But I understand. A tidy entrance is a sweet little trap.",
      "emotion": "thinking",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "tease_playful_002_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "tease_playful_002_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "さ、笑ったなら始めよう。笑ってないなら、なおさら始めよう。",
      "translatedText": "Now, if you laughed, start. If you did not laugh, start even more.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
